<title>USA: Proffitt's Q4 fully diluted shr $1.14.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's Q4 fully diluted shr $1.14.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reconciliation of Net Income</p>
<p>Proffitt's, Inc.</p>
<p>Fourth Quarter and Fiscal Year Ended Feb. 1, 1997</p>
<p>($ in millions)</p>
<p>				    Fourth Quarter	    Year</p>
<p>				  After			After</p>
<p>				     Tax	  EPS	Tax	EPS</p>
<p>Net income before</p>
<p>  non-recurring items	 34.2	 1.14     58.7     2.17</p>
<p>Herberger's merger,</p>
<p>restructuring, and</p>
<p>  integration costs	  (7.9)	(.26)    (7.9)    (.28)</p>
<p>Younkers merger,</p>
<p>restructuring, and</p>
<p>  integration costs	   (.6)	(.02)    (3.5)    (.13)</p>
<p>Herberger's markdowns,</p>
<p>write-offs, and reserves</p>
<p>				   (5.1)	(.17)    (5.1)    (.18)</p>
<p> ESOP charges		  (1.5)	(.05)    (2.6)    (.09)</p>
<p>Virginia store closing</p>
<p>  costs			  (2.9)	(.09)    (2.9)    (.10)</p>
<p>Disposal and write-off</p>
<p>  of property		   (.8)	(.02)	 .7	.02</p>
<p>Net income after</p>
<p>  non-recurring items	 15.4	  .53     37.4     1.41</p>
<p>NOTE : For the fiscal year ended in 1997, EPS before non-recurring items and after restatement to include Herberger's, were $.26 for the first quarter, $.18 for the second, $.49 for the third, and $1.14 for the fourth, for an annual EPS of $2.17.</p>
<p>For the fourth quarter of the fiscal year ended in 1996, earnings fully-diluted earnings beofre non-recurring items totaled 41.04 per share.</p>
